{"unit_id":"chinacaa__dsh-session-save#card-zh","repo":"chinacaa/dsh-session-save","commit":"c98d0bafcdd87de30a41a8de7cda7a4fb105fd7e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-save 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话工程文件插件，可将当前对话保存成便于携带的 .dsproj 文件，并在另一台机器或工作区重新打开。它通过会话标题栏和新会话区域的界面入口，连接 Host 路由与本机文件系统。主要功能包括首次选择位置后重复保存、另存为、按会话步骤自动保存，以及打开工程文件并处理工作区选择和会话冲突。保存过程中会记住文件位置并检查目标状态。适合需要归档、迁移或继续使用 DSH 会话的用户；不需要 API Key，工程文件保存在用户选择的本机位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2387","index.js:2784","index.js:2405"]}
{"unit_id":"chinacaa__dsh-session-save#card-en","repo":"chinacaa/dsh-session-save","commit":"c98d0bafcdd87de30a41a8de7cda7a4fb105fd7e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-save adds session save and reopen to DSH web. Save a conversation as a portable .dsproj file, overwrite its remembered file, or choose Save As. Autosave writes after conversation steps. Open a project to import and resume a session, choosing a workspace if needed. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2387","index.js:2784","index.js:2405"]}
